SUMMARY:DePIN, Pitches & Popcorn #2026
DESCRIPTION:How to turn Germany’s DePIN projects into a coherent mesh to support innovative industry collaboration\n\nCheck out the CIC cinema location of several infamous Blockchain meetup and the Blockchain Brunches.\nKick back and get into DePin while sipping a drink and enjoying popcorn.\nWe have brief intros of the organizers and their take on DePIN and innovations overall.\nOrganizer: Berchain e.V. & Bundesblock (Blockchain Bundesverband e.V.).\nVenue: CIC Berlin.\nChat: Telegram – https://t.me/+HdZPHQay6H5hMTAy
LOCATION:Lohmühlenstraße 65, 12435 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:17
X-VAR-QUARTILE:3
END:VEVENT
