SUMMARY:Funding the Commons Berlin #2026
DESCRIPTION:Funding the Commons brings "Infrastructures of Resilience: Stewarding Open Technologies & Public Goods" to Berlin: our urgent call to align incentives and coordintation around protecting, nourishing and catalyzing and open + decentralized technologies.\nJoin researchers, policymakers, builders, and funders at the 13th edition of Funding the Commons as we confront the future of AI, Web3, and digital public goods—not as idealized commons, but as contested spaces requiring intervention, governance, and resilient alternatives.\nOrganizer: Funding the Commons: Infrastructures of Resilience Symposium.\nVenue: Engelnest.\nChat: Telegram – https://t.me/1902068671/40
LOCATION:Wilhelm-Kabus-Straße 24, 10829 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:6
X-VAR-QUARTILE:1
END:VEVENT
