DTSTART:20260617T140000Z
DTEND:20260617T200000Z
SUMMARY:Movement Reforged #2025
DESCRIPTION:Join us on June 17th in the heart of Berlin for an evening of insight, connection, and next-gen innovation.\nThis  gathering marks the European debut of Movement Industries—spotlighting the Labs → Industries transition, the launch of the Frankfurt Finance Hub, and new waves of modular tech including Parthenon and Monza.\nExpect sharp minds, meaningful conversations, and a rooftop view into the future of crypto infrastructure.\nOrganizer: Move Industries.\nVenue: La Flor.
LOCATION:Französische Straße 15, 10117 Berlin
X-VAR-SCORE:19
X-VAR-QUARTILE:4
END:VEVENT
