DTEND:20260619T210000Z
SUMMARY:RWA-Tokenization: Real Estate Case Studies #2026
DESCRIPTION:The process of RWA tokenization is well underway.\nNow that the infrastructure has been created, the focus is on the projects.\nStephan Rind (CEO Brickmark AG), Achim Jedelsky (FIBREE) and Axel von Goldbeck (Partner at Möhrle Happ Luther) will draw on their extensive experience with a large number of projects and share the insights they have gained in the form of a panel discussion.\nOrganizer: MÖHRLE HAPP LUTHER.\nVenue: TOMAS – Transformation of Material and Space.
LOCATION:Mollstraße 1, 10178 Berlin
X-VAR-SCORE:10
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
