SUMMARY:Infrastructure for Culture — Day 1: Metadata |  Berlin Blockchain Week #2026
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for Day 1 of Infrastructure for Culture — a focused session on the evolving foundations of cultural tools, happening at LUKSO Hub during Berlin Blockchain Week.\n​We’ll explore how metadata standards and onchain notifications are enabling a new generation of programmable, creator-first infrastructure.\nThrough workshops and open discussions, we’ll unpack the systems, signals, and ideas shaping how culture is built and experienced onchain.\nOrganizer: LUKSO.\nVenue: LUKSO Hub.
LOCATION:Köpenicker Ch 3a, 10317 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:12
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
