SUMMARY:Builder Night Berlin - ZK edition - Presented by MetaMask 🦊 & Aztec #2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us on June 19th at w3.hub for a special Builder Night dedicated to Zero-Knowledge proofs and privacy in Web3.\nThis is not your typical crypto meetup.\nBuilder Nights are high-signal, no-shill gatherings for developers, researchers, and protocol teams who care about what’s next — and in this edition, we’re diving deep into the role of ZK tech in building more private, secure, and scalable onchain systems.\nOrganizer: MetaMask and Aztec.\nVenue: W3 Hub.\nChat: Telegram – https://t.me/+KtXibRxEUpA4YzY8
LOCATION:Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:2
X-VAR-QUARTILE:1
END:VEVENT
