SUMMARY:Sunset Social: Rooftop Sessions | human.tech (by Holonym) × LUKSO #2026
DESCRIPTION:​Join human.tech and LUKSO for Sunset Social at LUKSO Hub Berlin.\n​An open-air rooftop session with cocktails, light bites, and live DJs as we wrap Day 1 of Infrastructure for Culture.\nBuilders, creators, and friends — come catch the sunset and keep the conversations going.\nOrganizer: LUKSO.\nVenue: LUKSO Hub.
LOCATION:Köpenicker Ch 3a, 10317 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:11
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
