SUMMARY:Farconnect #2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Farconnect Berlin: A sufficiently decentralized Farcaster meetup during Berlin Blockchain Week.\nWtf is Farcaster?\nFarcaster is a protocol to build and distribute social apps.\nOrganizer: ekinci.xyz.\nVenue: Holzmarkt 25.\nChat: Other – https://warpcast.com/~/group/IJjKTeZGlRpVIQRDYP3xfQ
