SUMMARY:Core Connect meetup with Blockchain Founders Capital #2026
DESCRIPTION:Build What Matters.\nBuild on Core.\n​​Join us for the Core Connect Global Buildathon IRL Meetup in Berlin, Co-hosted with Blockchain Founders Capital — a high-energy in-person gathering of the most ambitious builders in BTCfi, AI, DeFi, Gaming, SocialFi, and Web3 Infra.\nOrganizer: Sagar Barvaliya.\nVenue: Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin.
LOCATION:Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin
