SUMMARY:Hashberg #2026
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for an intimate, 1-day event to collaborate on critical topics across the IPFS ecosystem!\nThe majority of the day will be spent in working sessions.\nTopics include:\n- ATProto Data Plumbing\n- IPFS Beyond Gateways\n- Improving CID Advertising and Routing\n- Private and Collaborative Networks\n- The State of Transports and Links (HTTP & beyond)\n- Rigour and Quality Metrics for IPFS\n\n​This summit brings together IPFS service providers, protocol designers, implementation maintainers, and developers of midsize and large content-addressed apps.\nOrganizer: IPFS Foundation.\nVenue: c-base.
LOCATION:Rungestraße 20, Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:11
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
