SUMMARY:Infrastructure for Culture — Day 2: Mini Apps | Berlin Blockchain Week #2024
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for Day 2 of Infrastructure for Culture — an open session dedicated to the apps and tools shaping the next foundation of culture onchain.\nWe'll explore the rise of mini apps, how they differ from traditional dApps, and why they’re radically easier to build.\nOrganizer: LUKSO.\nVenue: LUKSO Hub.
LOCATION:Köpenicker Ch 3a, 10317 Berlin, Germany
