SUMMARY:Rooftop Move and Groove by IOTA and Oak Security #2026
DESCRIPTION:Get a panoramic view of Berlin's skyline and learn about the latest blockchain development and security trends.\n​IOTA is a true OG in the crypto space and recently launched a full rebase of its protocol, making it one of the most secure, modern, scalable, and easy-to-use blockchains in the space.\n​\nOak Security is your one-stop shop for web3 cybersecurity.\nOrganizer: IOTA Foundation & Oak Security.\nVenue: Kunkerkranich.
LOCATION:Karl-Marx-Straße 66, 12043 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:6
