SUMMARY:Protocol Berg  #2026
DESCRIPTION:Protocol Berg is a conference focusing on protocol research, decentralized infrastructure, and core-developer experience.\nThe two-day event with multiple stages, opportunities for technical workshops, and protocol community gatherings brings together protocol researchers and other stakeholders from different decentralized protocols.\nAttendance is free of charge.\nOrganizer: Department of Decentralization.\nVenue: Colosseum.\nChat: Matrix – https://matrix.to/#/%23protocol:dod.ngo
LOCATION:Gleimstraße 30, 10437 Berlin-Prenzlauer Berg
X-VAR-SCORE:20
X-VAR-QUARTILE:4
