SUMMARY:House of ZK's Ethproofs Summit  #2026
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the House of ZK’s Ethproofs Summit - a focused, high-signal event diving into Ethereum’s enshrinement roadmap.\nThis gathering brings together Ethproofs contributors and related teams to unpack the implications of real-time proofs on Ethereum - technical, political, economic.\nAbout a Host\n\nHouse of ZK - HoZK is a platform dedicated to exploring and promoting the latest advancements in the Zero-Knowledge industry, designed to be a one-stop hub for anyone interested in ZK, and consists of three main pillars: Podcast, Journal, and Events.\nOrganizer: House of ZK.\nVenue: House of Music.\nChat: Telegram – https://t.me/ethproofs_community
LOCATION:Revaler Str. 99, 10245 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:17
X-VAR-QUARTILE:3
END:VEVENT
