SUMMARY:Daydream @night party #2026
DESCRIPTION:​Daydream Berlin ☁️✨\nA Party for Creators\n​June 14th | Sonnenraum, Berlin | 7 PM – 1 AM\n\n​Live from Berlin, we’re closing out Protocol Berg with a night made by creators and for creators thanks to Daydream.\nFree drinks and bouncy music guaranteed.\n​Daydream is Livepeer’s new tool that turns live video into live visual expressions.\nOrganizer: Daydream by Livepeer.\nVenue: Sonnenraum.
LOCATION:Eichenstraße 4a, 12435 Berlin, Germany
