SUMMARY:NoirCon2 #2025
DESCRIPTION:NoirCon 2 is coming to Berlin \n\n​🫡 Noir Güt \n\n​NoirCon first made its debut in Thailand, then expanded to the U.S.\nand now we’re headed to Germany for Berlin Blockchain Week!\n​If you care about privacy-first, next-gen Ethereum apps, NoirCon 2 is the place to start—and ship—your zk journey.\nOrganizer: Aztec Labs.\nVenue: Web3.hub.
LOCATION:Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin, Germany
