SUMMARY:DeFi Trading & Asset Management Summit #2026
DESCRIPTION:At the DeFi Trading & Asset Management Summit, we explore the next generation of capital coordination.\nFrom on-chain fund infrastructure to decentralized prop trading and AI-powered strategy execution, this summit brings together builders, traders, and fund managers reshaping how assets are managed in the permissionless and non-custodial economy.\n​Whether you're looking to capitalise on your DeFi edge, deploy algorithmic strategies, or build your own DeFi vault, this is the place to connect and exchange ideas.\nOrganizer: w3.group.\nVenue: w3.hub Creative Campus.
LOCATION:Tempelhofer Ufer 17, 10963 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:13
X-VAR-QUARTILE:3
END:VEVENT
