SUMMARY:PEER IDEATHON #2026
DESCRIPTION:Decentralizing Transparency: Building the Future of Social Media\n\nAbout the Ideaathon\nJoin us for an exciting Ideathon during Blockchain Week 2025, where innovators, developers, designers, and thinkers will rethink transparency, data ownership, and decentralisation in social media.\nThe goal is to reimagine platforms where users fully own and control their data by designing systems that securely store and distribute information across decentralised networks.\nThe Challenge\nCurrent social media platforms are controlled by centralised corporations with closed algorithms and restricted user data access.\nOrganizer: PEER NETWORK PSE.\nVenue: PEER NETWORK PSE WORKPLACE.
LOCATION:Möckernstraße 68/Aufgang C, 10965 Berlin
X-VAR-SCORE:12
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
