SUMMARY:Zesty coworking Café  #2026
DESCRIPTION:Step into our Zesty Coworking Café and join Hyli, the new proof-powered L1, for an afternoon of juicy ideas, bold builders, and sweet surprises.\nWhether you're here to dive into our tech or just vibe with the citrusy energy, you’ll leave refreshed, inspired, and maybe a little more orange.\nOrganizer: HYLI.\nVenue: Mitosis Lab 3.
LOCATION:Sonnenallee 67, 12045 Berlin, Germany
