SUMMARY:Alephium X Onekey Community Meetup #2025
DESCRIPTION:Welcome Alephium community members, PoW enthusiasts, on-chain degens, OneKey KOLs, and cold wallet lovers!\n​Join us for a fun and relaxed Friday evening at the bar.\n​We'll be serving:\n\n​Drinks: Berliner Berg Lager & Pils, house wines, and mineral water\n\n​Snacks: Chips and dips, bread and olives, salamis, and a veggie platter\n\n​Event Flow\n\n​Brief introduction to kick things off\n\n​Icebreaker games and a quiz — quiz winners will receive an Alephium x OneKey co-branded cold wallet!\nOrganizer: Alephium.\nVenue: Geist im Glas.
LOCATION:Lenaustraße 27, 12047 Berlin
X-VAR-SCORE:12
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
