SUMMARY:Against Crypto-Economics #2025
DESCRIPTION:Back in the halcyon days, our crypto "industry" understood itself to have embarked upon a project of crypto-economic engineering, where coordination problems were luscious opportunities for socio-technical mechanism design -- Bitcoin's "proof-of-work" the OG example.\nIn 2025, we find ourselves lost in a melancholic miasma of financial and cultural woes, reduced by the token-attention economy to debates over unlock schedules, cashflow metaphors, and at times a wise-but-reactionary rejection of anything that smells like a token whatsoever.When did we lose our sight of the toolkit right in front of us?\nWas cryptoeconomics ever great to begin with?\nOrganizer: Anoma.\nVenue: Haus Ungarn.
LOCATION:Karl-Liebknecht-Str. 9, 10178 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:8
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
