SUMMARY:Satoshi Nakamoto Forum - Take the Orange Pill #2026
DESCRIPTION:🇩🇪 German Blockchain & AI Week presents:\n\n​An Exclusive ₿itcoin Evening in Berlin\n\n​Join us on June 14, 2025, at Berlin 🏙️ Spielfeld Hub for an unforgettable evening dedicated to the vision of Satoshi Nakamoto and the revolution of decentralized money 🌐.\nThis exclusive gathering is a must-attend for Bitcoin believers, blockchain enthusiasts, and industry leaders.\n​What to Expect:\n\n​🗣️ Keynote & Expert Talks – Gain insights from top Bitcoin thinkers on Bitcoin’s impact, philosophy, DeFi, and the mother of all blockchains\n\n​🎬 Exclusive Movie Premiere – Take the Orange Pill, a deep dive into the origins, impact, and legacy of Bitcoin\n\n​🍹 Legacy Drinks & Finger Food – Enjoy great conversations over delicious refreshments\n\n​🤝 Elite Networking – Connect with Bitcoiners, blockchain pioneers, and innovators on a beautiful summer Saturday evening in Berlin\n\n​Agenda:\n\n​🕔 5:30 PM – Registration\n🎤 6:30 PM – Keynotes, Q&A Session & Panel\n🎬 7:00 PM – Take the Orange Pill – Satoshi Nakamoto (Movie Premiere)\n🍽️ 8:30 PM – Networking, Finger Food & Drinks\n\n​📍 Location: Berlin Spielfeld Hub\n📅 Date: June 14, 2025\n⏰ Time: 5 PM – 10 PM\n🎟️ Free Entry – Registration Required \n\n​🔝 Priority Registration: Secure your spot with our GBW&AI 💎 VIP Ticket ✅\n\n​🚀 Secure your spot now and get ready to Take the Orange Pill!\nOrganizer: German Blockchain & AI Week.\nVenue: Spielfeld Hub.\nChat: Telegram – https://t.me/germanblockchainweek
LOCATION:Skalitzer Str. 85/86, 10997 Berlin
X-VAR-SCORE:18
X-VAR-QUARTILE:3
