DESCRIPTION:We currently experience a worldwide rise in real world asset tokenization that includes a massive increase of real estate tokenization solutions.\nTherefore we would like to spend this evening listening to RWA solution providers and how they plan to develop this market further:\n\nSustainable investments with arcneo bonds\nDespot Bitschnau & Jens Bredler, arcneo - https://arcneo.de/\nTokenized rights on Real Estate\nChristopher Haß, TokeItReal - https://tokeitreal.com/\nA new, more accessible way to invest in real estate!\nBogdan Almasi, asseto - https://assettoapp.com/\nInvest where you enjyo life - Tiny House Resorts in Portugal\nAchim Jedelsky, OWR Invest - https://owrinvest.com/\nI hope you will join in a discussion about this exciting topic and the state of the industry!\nOrganizer: Achim Jedelsky.\nVenue: w3.hub.
