DTEND:20260616T210000Z
SUMMARY:A taste of integrating 350 Assets over 75 Blockchains #2026
DESCRIPTION:About the EventJoin us for an exclusive evening hosted by Bitvavo, where crypto infrastructure meets real-world scale.\nOver drinks and bites, we’ll take you behind the scenes of one of Europe’s leading digital asset platforms—and share what it really takes to support 350+ assets across 75+ blockchains.In this session, we’ll unpack the technical and operational challenges of Web3 at scale.\nFrom managing high-throughput networks, to navigating new models of transaction finality on chains, to decoding the growing complexity of smart contract-based deposits—this is your backstage pass to the next generation of crypto integration.Stick around for an open Q&A, where our engineering and product leads will answer your questions and dive deeper into the realities of building resilient, scalable systems in an increasingly complex blockchain ecosystem.EVENT HIGHLIGHTS:\n\n\n\n\n\nA technical deep dive: Web3 at Scale – Behind the Scenes of Integrating 350 Assets on 75 Chains\n\n\n\nInsightful discussion on high-speed blockchains, new finality models, and the evolving role of smart contracts\n\n\n\nInteractive Q&A session with Bitvavo team members\n\n\n\nCasual networking with fellow builders, devs, and crypto-curious minds\n\n\n\nDrinks, bites, and a relaxed atmosphere\n\nWhether you're a developer, founder, or just passionate about Web3 infrastructure, this event offers a rare look into how enterprise-level crypto platforms operate under the hood.\nOrganizer: Bitvavo .\nVenue: w3.hub Berlin.
LOCATION:Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:12
X-VAR-QUARTILE:2
END:VEVENT
