SUMMARY:Eureka #2026
DESCRIPTION:Eureka Conference is a space for thoughtful exchange and shared discovery in the world of blockchain and decentralized technologies.\nThrough talks on governance, decentralized digital economy, and scaling solutions - alongside workshops and panel discussions -participants explore ideas that push the space forward.\nTrue to its name, Eureka is about those moments of insight that happen when people come together to ask hard questions and imagine what is next.\nOrganizer: Robin Böning.\nVenue: Pfefferberg Haus 13.\nChat: Discord – https://discord.gg/fdK3K3nSDe
