SUMMARY:Bitwala Invite Only Investor Lunch #2026
DESCRIPTION:# Bitwala's Invite-Only VC Lunch.\\n## 🟩 Who's invited?\\n​💶 Angel Investors\\n💷 Early Stage VCs\\n🧸 Founders incorporated or with a presence in Berlin\\n🏆BWALA Whales and Leviathans\\n​\\nWe'll be discussing what to look for in the afternoon pitches, fundraising strategies, the dynamics between founders and investors, how regulatory and technical advancements influence the investment flow and how media might play a role.\\n\\n​If you are a Start Up and want to pitch, are looking for high-context networking, a chance to get in early on the scene or any combination of the above, [please use this link](https://lu.ma/raal3k5j) for our afternoon event.\\n\\n​🟩 Notes:\\n​While the lunch is accessible the venue for the later events is not.\nSorry for that.\\n\\n​Participation to the Lunch is subject to selection and approval.\\n\\n​We will take photographs and videos.\nBy registering and attending, you agree to appear on marketing videos and photos for Berlin Blockchain Week as well as parties involved in the hosting or participating in this event.\\n\\n​Your data may be used for event documentation, marketing materials, and promotional purposes.\\n\\n​🟩Sponsorship Opportunities!\nOrganizer: Dennis Daiber.\nVenue: MENA Kreuzberg.
LOCATION:Revealed upon Registration
