SUMMARY:Stablecoin Day at Berlin Blockchain Week #2026
DESCRIPTION:​Stablecoins have emerged as a significant innovation in the financial sector in recent years.\nWhile traditional cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin and Ethereum are known for their volatility, Stablecoins offer a more stable store of value as they are pegged to traditional currencies or other assets.\nThis makes them suitable for payments as well as for new use cases in decentralized finance (DeFi).\nOrganizer: AllUnity.\nVenue: w3.hub.
LOCATION:w3.hub, Möckernstraße 120, 10963 Berlin, Germany
X-VAR-SCORE:18
